# Finance v2: reviewed exceptions to the "added lines only" rule for protected
# legacy files (docs/finance-v2/DESIGN.md §1.4 point 5). One entry per line:
#   <file><TAB><hunk hash><TAB><one-line reason>
# scripts/finance-v2-additive-diff.ts prints the exact line for a failing hunk.
