src/modules/ejar/ejar.module.ts	78db2389602302a6	EJ-1 (flag off, issue 11a): the legacy Ejar attach matches invoices to RENT rows only (matchEjarInvoices), so a fee on the same due date is no longer stamped as rent and marked paid
src/modules/ejar/ejar.module.ts	915ad24dbaa6cd99	EJ-1 (flag off, issue 11b): the legacy status comes from mapEjarStatusLegacy, so "مدفوعة جزئياً" is partially_paid, not paid
src/modules/ejar/ejar.module.ts	320799a465cbd1ab	EJ-1 (flag off, issue 11i): the legacy stamp is ejarInvoiceDescription, which always begins "فاتورة إيجار" so a numberless rent invoice is not read as a fee
